  "contributor": "acry",
  "part": "the heavy gallop section where the whole band comes in (about 0:40 into the recording, right after the main riff over the toms): three bars of the palm-muted pedal gallop and the climbing eighth-note run, twice, then the gallop again, the run a third time and two more bars of gallop -- Songsterr bar",
  "key": "D minor (original is Eb minor, guitars tuned down a half step; down a half step and up two octaves -- shift +23 -- because the run spans Eb2..E3 and the old +14/+26 F-minor shift puts the pedal below B3 or the run's top above F5; +23 needs 8 modifiers vs 74-144 for every other fitting shift)",
